      "guid": "com.maschine.morequickslots",
      "name": "MoreQuickSlots",
      "slug": "morequickslots",
      "teaser": "When you simply can't decide - Increases the number of freely assignable quick slots by up to 6 additional slots",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/XKHKbSIxWHcdJLOyATKrlw9J1TcEad4z14yR1aQd.png",
      "downloads": 1101,
      "favourites_count": 11,
      "description": "<p>Client-side mod that increases the number of freely assignable quick slots from the default 7 by up to 6 additional slots.</p>\n<p>Key bindings and the number of slots can be customized in the BepinEx menu.</p>\n<h1><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maschine34675/MoreQuickSlots/refs/heads/main/example2.png\" alt=\"example\" /></h1>\n<h1><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maschine34675/MoreQuickSlots/refs/heads/main/example1.png\" alt=\"example\" /></h1>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>As usual, unzip to your SPT directory.</p>\n<h2>Uninstalling</h2>\n<p><strong>Important:</strong> Before removing the mod, <strong>empty all extra slots</strong> (drag the items off the slots). The bindings live in the server profile; the vanilla client does not know slot numbers 12+ and the character/inventory screen will no longer load until you either reinstall the mod, or delete the key manually in your profile.json</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2812/morequickslots",
      "fika_compatibility": true,
      "featured": false,
      "contains_ads": false,
      "contains_ai_content": true,
      "custom_ai_disclosure": "<p>AI was used to find the correct classes/methods to patch in the game’s source code. The thumbnail is AI generated.</p>\n",
